+# ============ trig & logs (series with range reduction) ============
+# Accuracy: floats are f64 and every routine below reduces its argument
+# onto a small interval before summing a Taylor/atanh series, giving
+# ~1e-9 or better over the tested ranges. Constants PI and E are f64.
+
+PI: float = 3.141592653589793
+E: float = 2.718281828459045
